  "title": {
    "zh": "Fort Building Kit大型拼搭积木套装",
    "en": "Fort Building Kit Large Block Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向儿童创意拼搭与互动场景的大型堡垒积木套装，适用于家庭、教学活动和主题展示空间，可通过杆件与连接件组合形成多种结构。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地中国东莞，支持导购视频和跨境渠道资料配置，适合出口类渠道供货。",
    "en": "This is a large fort-building block set for children’s creative construction and interaction scenarios. It fits home use, educational activities, and themed display spaces through rod-and-connector structures.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Dongguan, China. Guide video support and cross-border channel documentation are available for export-oriented supply."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款Fort Building Kit大型拼搭积木套装以杆件和连接球为核心结构，支持搭建帐篷、堡垒和创意空间造型，适用于亲子互动和小组活动。",
      "产品定位儿童拼搭类玩具，支持多功能玩法和重复拆装。品牌为尧顺，可用于教学活动、零售陈列和互动体验区布置。",
      "商品采用彩盒包装，规格为yg100pcs，配套体积与重量信息完整，适合出口渠道和批量采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This Fort Building Kit large block set uses rods and connector balls to build tents, forts, and creative spatial structures for parent-child and group activities.",
      "The product is positioned as a children’s construction toy with multi-function play and repeatable assembly. Brand: Yaoshun. It can be used in educational activities, retail display, and interactive play zones.",
      "Packed in a color box with complete volume and weight data, model yg100pcs is suitable for export channels and bulk procurement."
    ]
  },
